Usage: harness <command> {type} <drive/partition> [--flag]

Commands:
  attach                  Mount a specific drive
  detach                  Unmount a specific drive


Flags:
  --generation N          Attach generation N instead of @ (root only,
                          mounted read-only)
  --help                  Show this help

